#   intended to run in multiplame environments; otherwise, check them in:
# .python-version

# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if git is used, you may want to ignore Pipfile.lock due to
#   git unresolved conflicts.
# Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, poetry.lock can be ignored or included.
